## Copy this file to "local.properties" (same directory) and fill in your own values.
## "local.properties" is git-ignored — never commit your real API key.

sdk.dir=/path/to/your/Android/Sdk

## CoinMarketCap Pro API key. Get one at https://pro.coinmarketcap.com/account
CMC_API_KEY=coloque_sua_chave_aqui
